<!-- ══ ABOUT ══ -->
<section class="about" id="about">
  <p class="eyebrow sr">Our story</p>
  <h2 class="section-title sr d1">More than <em>fashion.</em><br>A movement.</h2>
  <p class="body-text sr d2">Dulcie's was founded on a beautifully simple idea — that the clothes you wear can do real good in the world. Every rack inside our Shop 15 home at Adelaide Arcade holds a rotating curated collection of high-end vintage and pre-loved pieces, hand-selected, repaired, and priced so everyone can participate.</p>
  <div class="pull-quote sr d2">
    <p>"Saving the planet one frock at a time — and giving back to the community with every single sale."</p>
  </div>
  <p class="body-text sr d3">We're solving two problems at once: the mountains of quality textiles discarded to landfill every year, and the growing number of Adelaideans experiencing homelessness. When you shop at Dulcie's, you're scoring something extraordinary and directly funding the people who need it most.</p>

  <div class="stats-row sr d3">
    <div class="stat-cell"><span class="stat-cell-num">100%</span><span class="stat-cell-label">Profits Donated</span></div>
    <div class="stat-cell"><span class="stat-cell-num">5.0★</span><span class="stat-cell-label">Customer Rating</span></div>
    <div class="stat-cell"><span class="stat-cell-num">Daily</span><span class="stat-cell-label">New Arrivals</span></div>
    <div class="stat-cell"><span class="stat-cell-num">2</span><span class="stat-cell-label">Charity Partners</span></div>
  </div>
</section>

